  "implementation": [
    "The original 1MiB staging, word CopyRecording, Runtime FIFO and Completion retirement mechanism remain. A lazy independent 8B device scratch joins at most head2 + word-aligned middle + tail2; edge copies use the existing native halfword Recording, not a host payload fallback.",
    "Both real edge ranges are prebound together before payload writes. Scratch is fully initialized through an original word copy; staging is never treated as STORAGE. Real source/destination logical ranges and neighboring padding are not expanded.",
